{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a fitness class app design task. Let me summarize the requirements:\n\n**Product**: Workout Class — fitness classes and activity tracking app\n**Canvas**: 414 × 896, iPhone, light mode\n\n**4 frames required:**\n\n1. **01_Onboarding**\n   - Goal: Understand what the app offers and start.\n   - Must include:\n     - Actions: \"Get started\" (button)\n     - Copy: \"Best workouts for you\" · \"You will have everything you need to reach your personal fitness goals — for free!\"\n     - Media: Illustration_Onboarding\n   - Link: Get started → 02_Home\n\n2. **02_Home**\n   - Goal: Find a workout class.\n   - Must include:\n     - Categories: \"Categories\" · \"See all\" · Warm up · Yoga · Squats · Lunge, each with its photo\n     - Greeting: \"Hello, Adam Smith\" · Avatar_Adam_Smith · menu (Icon_Menu)\n     - Main navigation: tab bar Home / Activity / Profile / Settings · current: Home\n     - Recommendation Class: \"Recommendation Class\" · \"See all\" · Yoga Class · \"With Rachael Wisdom\" · Photo_Yoga_Class · favorite (Icon_Heart)\n     - Search: \"Search\" (Icon_Search)\n     - Title: \"Find Your Workout Class\"\n     - Today's activity: \"Today's activity\" · 8.00 AM - 1.30 PM · Illustration_Todays_Activity\n   - Links: Warm up category → 03_Warm_Up; Activity tab → 04_Activity\n\n3. **03_Warm_Up**\n   - Goal: Understand the Warm up session and pick an exercise.\n   - Must include:\n     - Actions: back (Icon_Back) · more (Icon_More) · play video (Icon_Play)\n     - Description: \"Warm up properly before exercising to prevent injury and make your workouts more effective.\"\n     - Exercises: \"Exercises\" · Exercise 1 – Exercise 10, each with photo, duration and play (Icon_Play_Small)\n     - Main navigation: tab bar · current: Home\n     - Media: Photo_Seated_Hug (video cover)\n     - Tags: 37.10 mins (Icon_Clock) · Running (Icon_Running)\n     - Title: \"Warm up\"\n   - Links: back → 02_Home; Activity tab → 04_Activity\n\n4. **04_Activity**\n   - Goal: Review the calories and activities of a day this week.\n   - Must include:\n     - Actions: back (Icon_Back) · more (Icon_More)\n     - Activities: Running · Swimming · Cycling, each with time range, hours and kilometers\n     - Calories: 1680 kcal\n     - Chart: hourly calories, axis 8AM · 10AM · 12PM · 2PM · 4PM · selected: 4PM · 120 cal\n     - Main navigation: tab bar · current: Activity\n     - Title: \"Your activities\"\n     - Week: \"This week\" · Sat 26 – Fri 01 · selected: Mon 28\n   - Links: back → 02_Home; Home tab → 02_Home\n\n**Fixed data:**\n- User: Adam Smith (Avatar_Adam_Smith) · greeting \"Hello, Adam Smith\"\n- Today's activity: 8.00 AM - 1.30 PM (Illustration_Todays_Activity)\n- Recommendation Class: Yoga Class · With Rachael Wisdom (Photo_Yoga_Class)\n- Categories (in this order): Warm up (Photo_Seated_Hug), Yoga (Photo_Meditation), Squats (Photo_Squat), Lunge (Photo_Lunge)\n- Warm up (03): Tags: 37.10 mins · Running; Video cover: Photo_Seated_Hug\n- Exercises (03, in this order):\n  - Exercise 1 · 02.30 Minutes (Photo_Forward_Fold)\n  - Exercise 2 · 02.00 Minutes (Photo_Chair_Pose)\n  - Exercise 3 · 03.20 Minutes (Photo_Side_Plank)\n  - Exercise 4 · 02.30 Minutes (Photo_Bent_Over)\n  - Exercise 5 · 05.30 Minutes (Photo_Meditation)\n  - Exercise 6 · 06.10 Minutes (Photo_Seated_Hug)\n  - Exercise 7 · 04.50 Minutes (Photo_Lunge)\n  - Exercise 8 · 03.30 Minutes (Photo_Arm_Stretch)\n  - Exercise 9 · 01.30 Minutes (Photo_Back_Bend)\n  - Exercise 10 · 05.20 Minutes (Photo_Tabletop_Kick)\n- Week (04): Sat 26 · Sun 27 · Mon 28 (selected) · Tue 29 · Wed 30 · Thu 31 · Fri 01; 1680 kcal; Chart: 8AM – 4PM, selected 4PM · 120 cal\n- Activities (04, in this order):\n  - Running · 8.00 AM - 9.30 AM · 1.32 hours · 9.50 kilometers\n  - Swimming · 8.00 AM - 9.30 AM · 1.32 hours · 9.50 kilometers\n  - Cycling · 8.00 AM - 9.30 AM · 1.32 hours · 9.50 kilometers\n\n**Fixed (given):**\n- Brand color #24C8FE and Inter\n- Media: illustrations, avatar, photos, icons\n- Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell (status bar, home indicator)\n\n**Navigation:**\n- Bottom tab bar on 02, 03, 04 with 4 tabs: Home (Icon_Home), Activity (Icon_Activity), Profile (Icon_Profile), Settings (Icon_Settings). Current: Home on 02 and 03, Activity on 04.\n- 01_Onboarding → Get started → 02_Home\n- 03_Warm_Up pushed from Warm up category card on 02\n- Entry only (no frames needed): menu, avatar, search, Today's activity card, See all, Yoga Class, favorite, Yoga / Squats / Lunge, more, play video, exercise rows, days, chart hours, activity cards, Profile and Settings tabs\n\nNow let me read 01 · Foundations for visual specs.","signature":"8d10961dad03495c93b09ce0"}],"id":"26725edd-9e40-4363-bac8-98cb3c55379e","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4461202f-e76f-4edc-acde-2f8130872b79","uuid":"11b3f2fe-bc60-44b1-9ddf-bf632337f365","timestamp":"2026-11-02T07:49:51.960Z","thinking_duration_ms":18211}
