 Indicator\" x=\"462\" y=\"0\" width=\"414\" height=\"34\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4461202f-e76f-4edc-acde-2f8130872b79","uuid":"81c54d11-cb45-4ead-904f-6aae886fe44a","timestamp":"2026-11-02T07:50:07.283Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"1:3\" name=\"02 · Components 组件库\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"1:19\" name=\"Components\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1400\" height=\"599\">\n    <text id=\"1:20\" name=\"Components · Workout Class (default states only)\" x=\"56\" y=\"48\" width=\"780\" height=\"39\" />\n    <text id=\"1:21\" name=\"Only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell are given. Every other state (pressed, focused, current tab, selected day, selected hour, favorited, playing…), the headers, the tab bar and every business component (activity card, class card, category cards, duration and activity tags, exercise rows, day pills, chart, activity summary cards…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\" x=\"56\" y=\"107\" width=\"1288\" height=\"57\" />\n    <text id=\"1:22\" name=\"Button · default\" x=\"56\" y=\"184\" width=\"134\" height=\"22\" />\n    <symbol id=\"1:23\" name=\"Button\" x=\"56\" y=\"226\" width=\"161\" height=\"46\" />\n    <text id=\"1:25\" name=\"Text Field · default\" x=\"56\" y=\"292\" width=\"160\" height=\"22\" />\n    <symbol id=\"1:26\" name=\"Text Field\" x=\"56\" y=\"334\" width=\"374\" height=\"75\" />\n    <text id=\"1:30\" name=\"Platform shell · system UI (not evaluated)\" x=\"56\" y=\"429\" width=\"358\" height=\"22\" />\n    <text id=\"1:31\" name=\"iOS status bar (with notch) and home ind