{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark (unattended session). The user's instruction (in Chinese): in the assigned Figma file https://www.figma.com/design/7rLveN0IHU79pD7QwJ97Mb/ (fileKey `7rLveN0IHU79pD7QwJ97Mb`), read 「00·Start Here」 for the design task, follow 「01·Foundations」 visual specs, reuse 「02·Components」 components, use 「04·Media」 assets, and deliver the complete design into 「03·Workspace」. Constraints from the benchmark brief: confirm account is zhengyaozhi@tetras.ai via whoami before writing (done ✓); use only this assigned file; preserve all reference pages; build the 4 named frames exactly (01_Onboarding, 02_Home, 03_Warm_Up, 04_Activity, 414×896, light mode), create reusable components, wire prototype links, verify all screens via screenshots; include \"Reasoning summary:\" before every tool call and in the final answer; final answer must state file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and remaining limitations. Never use loadAllPagesAsync, setPluginData, or createImageAsync.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via `mcp__figma__use_figma` (code runs with `figma` global; max 50k chars/call)\n   - `figma.getNodeByIdAsync` (NOT getNodeAsync — doesn't exist)\n   - `figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)` required to change pages\n   - `figma.combineAsVariants([a,b], parent)` for variant sets; children named \"Prop=Value\" before combining\n   - `instance.swapComponent(component)` for nested instance swaps\n   - `node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:'CLICK'}, action:{type:'NODE', navigationType:'NAVIGATE', destinationNodeID, transition}}]` for prototype links (planned)\n   - Auto-layout: `layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL'` must be set AFTER `appendChild` to the auto-layout parent\n   - `appendChild` returns void — use a `put(parent, node, x, y)` helper\n   - Nested instances inside instances: fills/characters/swap/resize CAN be overridden; x/y (relative-transform) CANNOT\n   - Fonts must load before text ops: Inter styles \"Regular\", \"Medium\", \"Semi Bold\", \"Bold\", \"Extra Bold\"\n   - Icon recoloring: `inst.findAll(n=>n.type==='VECTOR').forEach(v=>{v.fills=[color]})`\n   - Media components instantiated directly via `createInstance()` from other pages in same file\n   - Pose photos = transparent image fills (FIT mode → resize letterboxes); illustrations/avatar/class photo = FILL image fills\n   - Vector chart via `vectorPaths` with `M/C/L/Z` path data\n   - Status bar white variant: override child fills to white except Notch\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file 7rLveN0IHU79pD7QwJ97Mb** — 5 pages: 0:1 (00·Start Here), 1:2 (01·Foundations), 1:3 (02·Components), 1:4 (04·Media), 5:2 (03·Workspace, EMPTY — delivery target)\n   - **Brief (00·Start Here) requirements**: \n     - 01_Onboarding: \"Get started\" button, \"Best workouts for you\", \"You will have everything you need to reach your personal fitness goals — for free!\", Illustration_Onboarding; link: Get started → 02_Home\n     - 02_Home: Categories (\"Categories\"/\"See all\" + Warm up·Yoga·Squats·Lunge with photos), greeting \"Hello, Adam Smith\" + Avatar_Adam_Smith + Icon_Menu, tab bar (current Home), Recommendation Class (\"Yoga Class\"·\"With Rachael Wisdom\"·Photo_Yoga_Class·Icon_Heart), Search (Icon_Search), \"Find Your Workout Class\", Today's activity (8.00 AM - 1.30 PM, Illustration_Todays_Activity); links: Warm up card → 03_Warm_Up, Activity tab → 04_Activity\n     - 03_Warm_Up: back/more/play video icons, description \"Warm up properly before exercising to prevent injury and make your workouts more effective.\", Exercises 1–10 with photos/durations/play small, tab bar (current Home), Photo_Seated_Hug video cover, tags 37.10 mins (Icon_Clock)·Running (Icon_Running), title \"Warm up\"; links: back → 02_Home, Activity tab → 04_Activity\n     - 04_Activity: back/more, Running·Swimming·Cycling cards (8.00 AM - 9.30 AM · 1.32 hours · 9.50 kilometers each), 1680 kcal, chart (8AM·10AM·12PM·2PM·4PM, selected 4PM·120 cal), tab bar (current Activity), \"Your activities\", week Sat 26–Fri 01 selected Mon 28; links: back → 02_Home, Home tab → 02_Home\n   - **Reference component nodes**: Button 1:23 (161×46, #24C8FE, r23, \"Get started\" white Inter Semi Bold 16); Text Field 1:26 (374×75; label \"Search\" #1A1A1F SB14 + Input 374×50 #F5F5F5 r12, placeholder \"Search\" #C4C4C4 Regular 16); Status Bar 1:33 (414×44 black glyphs); Home Indicator 1:44 (414×34, bar 134×5)\n   - **Media nodes**: Illustration_Onboarding 3:3 (219×260), Illustration_Todays_Activity 3:31 (142×142, fill #A3D2EF), Avatar_Adam_Smith 3:2 (108×72), Photo_Yoga_Class 3:15 (200×160); poses: Arm_Stretch 3:4, Back_Bend 3:5, Bent_Over 3:6 (222×160), Chair_Pose 3:7, Forward_Fold 3:8 (240×160), Lunge 3:9 (240×160), Meditation 3:10, Seated_Hug 3:11 (107×160, FIT), Side_Plank 3:12, Squat 3:13 (240×160), Tabletop_Kick 3:14 (240×160); icons: Activity 3:16, Back 3:17 (18×14.87), Clock 3:18, Cycling 3:19, Heart 3:20, Home 3:21, Menu 3:22 (20×14), More 3:23 (9×27), Play 3:24 (28×31.5), Play_Small 3:25 (15.56×17.5), Profile 3:26, Running 3:27 (14.07×16), Search 3:28, Settings 3:29, Swimming 3:30\n   - **Created components (my design system) — IDs**:\n     - Call A: Icon Button 8:2 (40 circle white + Icon_Back ink at 11,12.5); Section Header 8:10 (366×28 SPACE_BETWEEN: Title Bold 18 ink + \"See all\" Medium 14 brand); Tag Chip 8:13 (hug, brandSoft bg r16, pad 12/7, Icon_Clock #0FA6DC + \"37.10 mins\" SB13); Play Button 8:19 (64 white circle + Icon_Play brand at 18,16.25); Day Pill set 8:29 (Default 8:23: white bg stroke line, \"Sat\" M11 sub + \"26\" SB15 ink; Selected 8:26: brand bg white text)\n     - Call B: Tab Bar set 10:44 — Current=Home 10:2, Current=Activity 10:23 (414×84, white 0.96, top radius 24, up-shadow, 4 tabs Home/Activity/Profile/Settings each icon+label 11, active brand SB / inactive #9AA6B2 Medium, item FILL); Category Card 10:45 (84×118 vertical: PhotoBg 84×86 r16 brandSoft with PhotoSlot 76×66 at 4,10 clip + Photo instance, Label SB13); Exercise Row 10:50 (366×52 r14 white: Thumb 40×40 r10 + PhotoSlot/Photo(3:8), Info FILL col Name SB14/Duration M11 sub, Play 32 circle brandSoft + Icon_Play_Small brand); Activity Card 10:61 (366×76 r16 white shadow: IconBg 44 circle + Icon_Running brand, Info col Name SB15/Time M12, Stats col right-aligned Hours SB13/Dist M11)\n     - Call C partial: Class Card (complete, at 880,0 — 366×170 r20 white shadow, Title Bold18 at 20,30, Subtitle M13 sub at 20,58, Photo 3:15 140×140 r16 at 211,15, Favorite 36 circle white + Icon_Heart #FF6B6B at 307,23) and Today's Activity Card (complete, at 880,210 — 366×120 r20 brand gradient #24C8FE→#47D6FF, Title Bold18 white at 20,30, Time M14 white.9 at 20,58, Illustration 3:31 122×122 at 226,-1 vectors white.95) — IDs NOT returned (error before return); Screen Header PARTIAL (broken); Chart NOT created\n   - **Key helper code pattern** (used in every call):\n     ```js\n     const F = s => ({ family: 'Inter', style: s });\n     await Promise.all(['Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold','Extra Bold'].map(s => figma.loadFontAsync(F(s))));\n     const hex = (h, o = 1) => { const n = parseInt(h.slice(1), 16); return { type: 'SOLID', color: {...}, opacity: o }; };\n     const C = { brand:'#24C8FE', brandSoft:'#E4F6FE', ink:'#10232E', sub:'#71808C', faint:'#9AA6B2', surface:'#FFFFFF', line:'#EDF1F5' };\n     const SH = [{ type:'DROP_SHADOW', color:{r:0.06,g:0.15,b:0.24,a:0.08}, offset:{x:0,y:10}, radius:30, spread:-4, visible:true, blendMode:'NORMAL' }];\n     const ws = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('5:2'); await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\n     function put(parent, node, x, y) { parent.appendChild(node); node.x = x; node.y = y; return node; }\n     ```\n   - **Chart plan (not yet built)**: 366×188 r20 white; \"1680\" Extra Bold 28 at (20,16) + \"kcal\" M13 at (20,54); grid lines y 88/118/148; vals [40,55,70,60,85,75,90,105,120], pts x=20+i*40.75, y=152-(v/130)*84; smooth C-curve area (gradient brand a0.32→0) + stroke line brand 2.5; Dot at last pt; Tooltip \"120 cal\" ink bubble; axis labels 8AM/10AM/12PM/2PM/4PM centered at x 20/99.5/179/258.5/338, y162\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **MCP rate limit on first get_metadata** (\"reached the Figma MCP tool call limit\"): transient — retry succeeded.\n   - **`figma.getNodeAsync: no such property`**: Plugin API has no getNodeAsync → switched to `figma.getNodeByIdAsync`.\n   - **`FILL can only be set on children of auto-layout frames`** (Call B attempt 1, in tabItem): set `layoutSizingHorizontal='FILL'` before `appendChild`. Fix: append to auto-layout parent FIRST, then set FILL; also cleaned up partial nodes (removed children named 'Tab Bar…'/'Home'/'Activity' from ws).\n   - **`cannot set property 'x' of null`** (Call C attempt 1): `cl.appendChild(txt(...)).x = 20` — appendChild returns void. Fix: `put(parent, node, x, y)` helper; cleanup of partial components by name list.\n   - **`This property cannot be overridden in an instance: relative-transform`** (Call C retry, at `moreIcon.x = 15.5` on the nested Icon_More instance inside the Icon Button instance within Screen Header component): UNRESOLVED — position of nested instances inside instances is not overridable. Fix plan: rebuild Screen Header with natively-built circle button frames (Back frame 40×40 + Icon_Back at 11,12.5; More frame 40×40 + Icon_More 9×27 at 15.5,6.5) inside the component instead of swapping icons inside an Icon Button instance. Must clean up the partial Screen Header first.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Worked out full design system: colors (brand #24C