{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed: Class Card and Today's Activity Card do NOT exist (the failed call died before/during their creation — probably at put(cl, photo,...) actually... whatever). Need to create both now. \n\nClass Card: 366×170 r20 white shadow; Title Bold18 at 20,30; Subtitle M13 sub at 20,58; Photo_Yoga_Class 3:15 140×140 r16 at 211,15; Favorite 36 circle white + Icon_Heart #FF6B6B at 307,23.\n\nWait — Favorite circle white on white card? The card is white; the favorite button white circle with shadow maybe. Original design: heart button typically has soft bg. Let me make it white circle with drop shadow — fine on white card with shadow. Actually to be visible, give it brandSoft bg? Brief: Icon_Heart. Keep white circle + subtle shadow.\n\nPhoto instance: setting cornerRadius on instance — allowed (cornerRadius is overridable). resize allowed.\n\nToday's Activity Card: 366×120 r20 brand gradient #24C8FE→#47D6FF; Title Bold18 white at 20,30; Time M14 white 0.9 at 20,58; Illustration 3:31 122×122 at 226,-1 with vectors white 0.95.\n\nNote: put(ill) inside component sets x — earlier error \"relative-transform cannot be overridden in an instance\" occurred possibly here! photo/ill are instances inside component — should be OK (like icons in Call A). The earlier failure was moreIcon (nested inside an INSTANCE). So creating ill in component ta is fine.\n\nGradient fill: GRADIENT_LINEAR with stops brand(#24C8FE)→#47D6FF, transform horizontal [[1,0,0],[0,1,0]].\n\nThen after creating these, positions: cl at 880,0; ta at 880,210. Then build screens.\n\nLet me create both cards + then immediately start 01_Onboarding in same call? Keep manageable: create cards now, return IDs.","signature":"c5aaeda5108d4db399353c7e"}],"id":"f337dbb7-8b79-4c6d-b159-c8e6049c8379","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4461202f-e76f-4edc-acde-2f8130872b79","uuid":"7cf6dcc8-8b14-4ae4-833a-a5e0a75b5404","timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:11:56.085Z","thinking_duration_ms":10927}
