t Field component include label? 1:26 is 374×75: label \"Search\" SB14 at top + input 374×50. Yes.\n- Section Header instances: 8:10 (366×28) at 24,262 override Title \"Categories\" and show \"See all\"; at 24,438 Title \"Recommendation Class\", \"See all\" — maybe hide second \"See all\"? Brief says Categories has See all; Recommendation maybe not. Keep \"See all\" only on Categories; on Recommendation set visible false.\n- Category Cards 10:45 (84×118) at y300: x 24, 118, 212, 306.\n  - Card1 \"Warm up\": default label \"Warm up\"? Component label default — I set default 'Warm up' in Call B? Label default text: 'Warm up'. Photo default 3:8 (Forward_Fold) with brandSoft bg. For Warm up keep default.\n  - Card2 \"Yoga\": label override 'Yoga', swap PhotoSlot's Photo instance (nested inside PhotoSlot inside card instance) → 3:10 Meditation, bg override #EFE9FF. Swapping nested instance: find in card2: node named 'Photo' (instance of 3:8) inside 'PhotoSlot' frame → photo2.swapComponent(meditationComp). Position inside instance can't change but swap keeps position/size box. The PhotoSlot is 76×66 with photo 3:8 default resized to fit (240×160 → I resized to slot? In Call B, pose.resize(76,66)? I think I set photo resize to 76×66 FIT. After swap, new instance keeps 76×66 with FIT fill → letterboxed fine.\n  - Card3 \"Squats\": 3:13, bg #FFE9EC.\n  - Card4 \"Lunge\": label 'Lunge', 3:9, bg #FFF2E2.\n- Class Card 15:2 instance at 24,474.\n- Today's Activity Card 15:10 instance at 24,664.\n- Tab Bar 10:44 instance Current=Home at 0,812.\n- Home Indicator 1:44 at 0,862.\n- Menu button + avatar: avatar = instance 3:2 (Avatar_Adam_Smith 108×72) resize(48,48)? Aspect distorts; but FILL fill crops. 108×72 → 48×48 with FILL crop OK. cornerRadius 24.\n\nIDs needed for reactions: warmup card instance, tab bar instances. I'll return them.\n\nOne concern: greeting \"Hello, Adam Smith\" Bold 22 — brief says greeting \"Hello, Adam Smith\" + Avatar + Icon_Menu. Good.\n\nLet me write the call for 01 + 02. Keep code tight.\n\nFor swap: meditation comp id 3:10, squat 3:13, lunge 3:9 — those are COMPONENTS in 04 Media. swapComponent(comp) requires the component node object.\n\nNested photo find: cardInst.findOne(n => n.name === 'Photo' && n.type === 'INSTANCE').\n\nBg override: cardInst.findOne(n => n.name === 'PhotoBg').fills = [...] — PhotoBg is a frame inside component → overridable fills ✓.\n\nLabel override: cardInst.findOne(n => n.name === 'Label').characters = 'Yoga' (font loaded).\n\nTab bar instance: figma.getItemById? Use comp set 10:44 → default variant? createInstance on component set not allowed; need default variant: set.children find name 'Current=Home'. \n\nHome Indicator 1:44, Status Bar 1:33, Button 1:23, Text Field 1:26, Illustration 3:3.\n\nText auto-resize for headline: create text, set textAlignHorizontal='CENTER', resize(366, h) after setting characters with textAutoResize 'HEIGHT'? Set t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT' then t.resize(366, t.height). \n\nLine height: t.lineHeight = { value: 24, unit: 'PIXELS' }.\n\nWrite call now. Also return screen id + relevant node ids.","signature":"55e27196bef6450998d6178c"}],"id":"349163ab-f18c-409a-a167-00f7db7868b4","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4461202f-e76f-4edc-acde-2f8130872b79","uuid":"8b3c9ce7-d078-4416-b618-ff6d8f32879b","timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:13:15.421Z","thinking_duration_ms":53428}
