{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Found it: Tag Chip component is 100 TALL (h=100) — counterAxisSizingMode FIXED with height 100! I must have created it with resize(112,100) or default 100 height. Children centered vertically (icon y42). So chips render 100 tall — that's the bug.\n\nFix: set counterAxisSizingMode='AUTO' on the component → height hugs (7+16+7=30). Then instances shrink. Desc at y374: chip bottom = 326+30=356 → gap 18 ✓ fine. Exercises at 436 stays.\n\nAlso fix in same call:\n- 02 search icon: move to x 358 (right side), y 236.\n- 04 tooltip clamp: find chart component 13:24 Tooltip; set x = 366-20-tip.width (i.e., right-aligned inside card padding). tip width ~64-70 → x ≈ 276-282. Set tip.x = Math.min(tip.x, 366-20-tip.width).\n- Chart component fix propagates to instance ✓.\n\nChip component change propagates to instances ✓.\n\nOne more check: chip width 112 hug — after AUTO height fine.\n\nAlso chip2 x recompute? chip2.x = 24 + chip1.width + 10 — chip widths unchanged (112). Fine.\n\nApply fixes.","signature":"9d54807f144d422fa002dfc3"}],"id":"a268e8cb-bdd2-4fdf-914e-880b3a353b6a","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4461202f-e76f-4edc-acde-2f8130872b79","uuid":"f39c53bb-c0a3-4826-96a1-70f895273a0a","timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:21:41.159Z","thinking_duration_ms":7623}
